[{"client_msg_id":"0b26aefc-68b8-4072-9cd3-88d479ca3dfc","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あとmarkdownは非技術者でもなんとなく読めちゃうところが良いところなのかなーって思ってます。","ts":"1622299752.196900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XYGJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32b485a9-a1c2-4523-a85c-6c55ae90d0b8","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"Pandoc's markdownくらいアリアリなのが好き……！\nTable記法はどれも一長一短感ありますが、プレーンテキストエディタで困らず読めるくらいの小規模な表に留めて、規模の大きいものは外部ファイルを参照させる、リストなど他の表現手法を考える、が良いと思ってます。","ts":"1622299695.196100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L=/XN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f6c68a9-f831-46f5-a69e-a10c3255f837","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"mdはそのままでも読みやすいのが好きですね。ただしTableとLinkを除く","ts":"1622298086.192400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3AD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b3cebd6-3070-497c-a96f-c6fd98d59669","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"プレーンテキストまでいくと、結局ガタガタになるか、だったらミニマムmarkdown書く、となる","ts":"1622290960.191200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kgpfn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C9DE8E63-9295-4543-B473-DC85E529B918","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"HTMLも結局XHTMLにならなかったし、とにかく緩い構文が流行る傾向がありますね","ts":"1622290848.190600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kk/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d180f554-27b5-46a1-9474-3cef227f7a3b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"学習側のコストは低くとも、処理系のコストが低いとは限らない、ってのはありますね。移行のコストも。","ts":"1622288610.188200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JTe43"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c6309fd-9fca-4b89-9c5d-7c596c8433ab","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"結局「書けないことはない」とか「書けなくても大きく困らない」のが理由なんでしょうね…\n定義リストがなかろうとドキュメントそのものが書けなくなるわけじゃないからなあ","ts":"1622288568.187600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H=z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f42ba1fa-6c22-42d8-9397-d25ee419b46c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"処理側を作るのはそれなりにコストかかるからねぇ","ts":"1622288565.187500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s05"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33b07520-81ed-429c-bea7-9c77e74875a1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"多少不便でも書けないことはないので多少の文法の差だと今の資産を置き換えるモチベがないのかなーっとか思いました","ts":"1622288014.185900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T9C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd525968-2602-40a5-a836-0748daf1882b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"軽量マークアップ言語なんてプログラミング言語とかと比べれば学習コストぜんぜん高くないのに、なんで世代交代が起きるそぶりがないんだろう？","ts":"1622287891.185200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KC7h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd2acc04-7565-4eb8-a1be-d7e5a6edc55a","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"github fav markdown くらいじゃないと書けない…","ts":"1622287034.183100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YHz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4643a33-e9eb-49a1-a86c-fce3f504439c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"markdownとよべるのはcommonmarkに準拠しているものだけ(規格過激派)、いやまあ幅あるけどね","ts":"1622286341.182500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wHXj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c40b1ab0-cd77-43bc-a543-86f938334fe3","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"markdownと呼べるのはmarkdown.plがサポートしているものだけ（過激派）\n\nそこから派生したものが多すぎて・・・","ts":"1622286237.181900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H29N3"}